# ROV (ArduSub, vectored BlueROV2) with no GPS at all, from boot: the EKF has
# no position source and runs in constant-position mode, depth comes from the
# pressure sensor. The GCS dead-reckons (SYS CONFIG > NAVIGATION > Relative).
# Old and new parameter names both, for stable, beta and latest builds.
GPS1_TYPE 0
GPS_TYPE 0
SIM_GPS1_TYPE 0
SIM_GPS_DISABLE 1
